homeowners, restaurants/bars -> /", "Free estimates, competitive pricing, fast turnarounds -> /", "Leads sent to JA VISUALS INC. -> /services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in custom metal fabrication for residential, commercial, and industrial projects. Our team works with steel, aluminum, copper, and more to craft precision components, decorative elements, and structural pieces", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='new-york-metal-fabricator' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='New York Woodwork operates from a workshop in Brooklyn, New York. The company was founded in 1997 with the goal of designing and handcrafting custom cabinetry for discerning clients. While the website also references a 1995 start date, the founding year is explicitly stated as 1997 on the About page. No founders are named, and ownership structure is not disclosed.

It also offers ready-made cabinetry that can be customized to specific dimensions. Finishes range from paint and stain to thermofoil, Formica, and lacquer. Projects are managed end-to-end, from demolition through installation, with an in-house project manager coordinating trades. The Brooklyn workshop houses a team of craftspeople, though headcount and facility size are not published.

Clients include homeowners, architects, and interior designers, as well as developers of multi-unit condominiums and commercial properties. The portfolio spans restaurants, hospitals, hair salons, hotels, offices, and government facilities such as the NYPD. Notable past clients also include major department stores and business executives. The company serves the East Coast and has attracted repeat business from clients who return for second or third projects.

New York Woodwork emphasizes unparalleled customer service, the ability to custom-match wood grain to existing interiors, and quick turnaround times. It promotes competitive pricing, honesty, and attention to detail as differentiators. The firm has earned the Best of Houzz Badge for Service in 2015 and 2016 and was named a Top Vendor of 2015 by LandlordStation.com. A free design consultation is offered either in the showroom or by phone.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cabinetry", "Countertop fabrication", "Kitchen island construction", "Bathroom cabinetry", "Walk-in closet systems", "Custom furniture & built-ins", "Custom wood finishes (paint, thermofoil, Formica, stain, lacquer)", "Project management", "Demolition & reconstruction", "Installation", "Design consultation", "Ready-made cabinetry customization"], "industries": ["Residential (homeowners)", "Architecture & Design", "Multi-family residential (condominiums)", "Commercial construction", "Hospitality (restaurants, hotels)", "Healthcare (hospitals)", "Retail (department stores)", "Government (NYPD)", "Salons & Spas"], "materials": ["Wood", "Paint", "Thermofoil", "Formica", "Stain", "Lacquer", "Hardware"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom wood-grain matching to existing interiors", "End-to-end project management from demolition to installation", "Free design consultation (showroom or phone)", "Award-winning service (Houzz 2015, 2016; LandlordStation Top Vendor 2015)", "Quick turnaround on custom fabrication"], "facts_used": ["Company name: New York Woodwork -> db", "Location: Brooklyn, NY -> db, /", "Founded 1997 -> /about", "Founded 1995 mentioned -> /", "Custom cabinetry, woodworking services -> /about, /services", "Workshop in Brooklyn -> /about", "Services list (cabinets, countertops, islands, etc.) -> /about, /services", "Industries served: homeowners, architects, designers, condominiums, commercial, restaurants, h