UPDATE companies SET description='Norlake Manufacturing Co. operates from Elyria, Ohio, and has been delivering engineered transformer solutions for over fifty years. The company was founded on a philosophy of continued excellence in magnetics manufacturing and design, though the exact founding year and original founders are not publicly disclosed.

