UPDATE companies SET description='North Coast Components Inc. is based in Hudsonville, Michigan, and has operated since its inception in 1985. The company grew by developing long-term partnerships with both customers and suppliers, establishing itself as a combined distributor of electronic components and manufacturer of custom wire harnesses and cable assemblies. No founder names or ownership structure are disclosed in the available information.

