UPDATE companies SET description='Northland Furniture Company operates from Bend, Oregon, where it has been manufacturing commercial furniture for nearly 50 years.

The company designs, builds, and ships all furniture from its Central Oregon manufacturing facility. Its product range includes casegoods, upholstery, and doors for guest rooms, food and beverage areas, common spaces, and kitchens. An experienced team of craftsmen handles customization requests, adjusting dimensions, finishes, and configurations to meet project specifications.

Northland serves the hospitality sector, including hotels, timeshares, and senior living communities. A noted project includes the Benson Hotel in Portland, where project manager Cole Butler of Allied Partners praised the product''s durability and service. The company also supplies furniture for senior living facilities, incorporating accessibility features such as rounded corners, wheelchair-accessible tables, and vented case backs.

The company differentiates itself through domestic manufacturing, which it says allows faster lead times, reduced carbon footprint, and immediate post-installation support. A strict quality control process checks each piece before it leaves the facility, and senior living furniture carries a 10-year warranty. Reusable, damage-resistant packaging further reduces waste.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial furniture manufacturing", "Casegoods production", "Upholstery", "Door manufacturing", "Custom design and engineering", "Quality control inspection", "Reusable packaging"], "industries": ["Hospitality", "Hotels", "Timeshares", "Senior living", "Commercial facilities"], "materials": ["Domestically sourced wood", "Melamine", "High pressure laminate", "Reusable packaging materials"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in America with domestically sourced materials", "Pacific Northwest craftsmanship using regional materials", "Customizable furniture built to order", "Strict quality control with 10-year warranty on senior living furniture", "Reusable, damage-resistant packaging reducing waste"], "facts_used": ["Location: Bend, Oregon -> db", "Nearly 50 years in business -> /", "Manufactures commercial furniture for hotels, timeshares, senior living -> /, /about", "Uses domestically sourced materials from Pacific Northwest -> /, /about", "Manufacturing facility in Bend, Oregon -> /about", "Customizable furniture -> /about", "Quality control with 10-year warranty on senior living furniture -> /quality", "Reusable packaging -> /about", "Testimonial from Cole Butler, Allied Partners, Benson Hotel -> /", "Collections: Coastal, Mountain, Highway -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "All furniture is designed, built and shipped from our manufacturing facility in the heart of Central Oregon.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "",