UPDATE companies SET description='Nutmeg Table Company operates from Waterbury, Connecticut, where it builds custom furniture in a workshop staffed by craftsmen. While the founding year is not publicly stated, the company has established a reputation for made-to-order production rooted in New England woodworking traditions.

The shop produces custom coffee tables, dining tables, butcher blocks, and vanities, all made to order in small batches. Every project begins with detailed shop drawings that the customer reviews and approves before any wood is cut. Finishes are sampled at the client''s home to ensure compatibility with lighting and flooring.

