UPDATE companies SET description='O''Callaghan Cable Services, Inc. is based in Summerville, South Carolina, where it was established more than three decades ago. The company began as a local provider of telecommunication and cable construction services and has since expanded to handle projects across the United States.

The firm specializes in the construction, installation, and maintenance of fiber-optic and coaxial networks. Its crews perform aerial and underground cable placement, fiber blowing, microduct installation, fusion splicing, and electronic equipment installation for FTTx and cell-tower backhaul systems. The company also provides project management, inventory management, and full or partial turnkey delivery for network builds, upgrades, and rebuilds.

The company’s emergency rapid-response teams are deployed nationwide to restore service after both weather events and man-made accidents.

