UPDATE companies SET description='O''Neal Manufacturing Services (OMS) is headquartered in Vestavia Hills, Alabama, and operates as part of O''Neal Industries, a metals manufacturing network active since 1921. The company runs a dedicated structural steel fabrication plant in Fayette, Alabama, and manages a network of ten North American facilities stretching from Monterrey, Mexico, to Cedar Falls, Iowa.

OMS specializes in heavy steel fabrication, precision welding, complex CNC machining, and 5-axis laser processing, supported by advanced automation such as a robotic beam line, plasma and saw cutting, and paint finishing. The facilities produce high-volume repetitive parts, heavy-duty welded assemblies, and fabricated metal components for OEM supply chains, offering kitting and assembly as value-added services.

The company serves global OEMs in power generation, data centers, construction, material handling, transportation, and renewable energy. Its customer base includes Tier 1 partners in heavy equipment and infrastructure markets who rely on multi-site production for supply chain stability.

OMS differentiates itself through integrated multi-site manufacturing, providing a single point of contact for multi-step metal processing across its North American network. The company emphasizes proactive risk management, technical repeatability, and structural integrity, leveraging a century of industrial expertise to ensure on-time delivery and quality at scale.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural Steel Fabrication", "Heavy Steel Fabrication", "Precision Welding", "Complex CNC Machining", "5-Axis Laser Machining", "Robotic Beam Line Processing", "Plasma Cutting", "Saw Cutting", "Paint Finishing", "Powder Coating", "Kitting & Assembly"], "industries": ["Power Generation", "Data Centers", "Construction", "Material Handling", "Transportation", "Renewable Energy"], "materials": ["Steel", "Structural Steel"], "equipment": ["Robotic beam line", "Plasma cutting system", "Saw cutting equipment", "Paint finishing line", "5-axis laser machining center"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single point of contact for multi-step metal processing", "Proactive risk management for quality and on-time delivery", "Scalable partnership for high-volume OEM supply chains", "Advanced automation including robotic beam line and 5-axis laser machining"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Vestavia Hills, Alabama -> db", "Part of O''Neal Industries active since 1921 -> db", "Operates structural steel fabrication plant in Fayette, Alabama -> db", "Ten North American manufacturing facilities listed -> pages:/", "Capabilities: heavy steel fabrication, precision welding, complex CNC machining, robotic beam line, plasma cutting, saw cutting, paint finishing, powder coating, kitting & assembly -> db, pages:/", "Industries served: Power Generation, Data Centers, Construction, Material Handling, Transportation, Renewable Energy -> db, pages:/", "Certification: ISO9001 -> db", "Integrated multi-site manufacturing solutions,