UPDATE companies SET description='Its manufacturing capabilities center on Chiron 5-axis mill/turn machining with a secondary collet pick-off system for continuous production, complemented by precision Swiss turn machining. Quality assurance relies on a suite of inspection equipment including Keyence optical measurement systems, Brown & Sharpe coordinate measuring machines, and video and 3D comparators. The company maintains ISO 13485:2016 certification and FDA registration for the manufacture of orthopaedic implants and instruments, and it develops project-specific quality plans covering risk management, process validation, inspection methods, and statistical controls.

Odyssey serves customers in the orthopaedics, spine, and trauma markets, supplying components to medical device manufacturers. The firm was recognized in 2020 as one of MedTech Outlook''s Top 10 Contract Manufacturers.

