UPDATE companies SET description='Ohio Metal Fabricating Inc. operates from Dayton, Ohio, where it has built over forty years of experience in metal spinning and fabrication.

The shop specializes in hand metal spinning and CNC metal spinning, complemented by flat and three‑dimensional laser cutting. It can spin parts up to 104 inches in diameter with material thicknesses from 0.010 to 0.187 inches, holding tolerances as tight as 0.002 inches. In‑house capabilities extend to welding, penetrant inspection, punching, beading, anodizing, plating, painting, polishing, and custom assembly. Ninety‑nine percent of spinning tools and dies are produced internally, and CNC cells handle secondary operations such as trimming and drilling. Equipment includes six‑axis laser systems and an M & M CNC lathe with flanging and cutting functions.

The company serves customers across multiple industries, collaborating directly with their engineering and quality teams to reduce costs and shorten lead times. Its one‑stop‑shop model targets complex spun or laser‑cut metal components for clients who need integrated finishing and inspection services.

Ohio Metal Fabricating emphasizes an on‑time delivery rate above 99 percent, competitive pricing, and short lead times. The business was built on the premise that combining quality, speed, and precision benefits the customer’s bottom line, and it continues to position itself as a cost‑advantaged alternative to other fabrication methods.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hand metal spinning", "CNC metal spinning", "Flat laser cutting", "3D laser cutting", "Welding", "Penetrant inspection", "Punching", "Beading", "Anodizing", "Plating", "Painting", "Polishing", "Custom assembly", "Tooling design and fabrication", "Prototyping", "Forming", "Stamping", "Six-axis laser cutting", "CNC lathe with flanging and cutting", "Secondary operations (trimming, drilling)"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["M & M CNC lathe", "Six-axis laser cutting equipment", "CNC cells"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "\u00b10.002 in", "built_on": ["Over 99% on-time delivery record", "Short lead times and competitive pricing", "99% of spinning tools and dies made in-house", "In-house finishing services (anodizing, plating, painting, polishing)", "Custom tooling per customer specifications"], "facts_used": ["Dayton, Ohio headquarters -> db", "Over forty years of industry experience -> /", "Specializes in hand metal spinning, CNC metal spinning, flat and 3D laser cutting -> /about", "Spin capacity up to 104\u2033 diameter, thickness .010\u2033 to .187\u2033, tolerances .002\u2033 -> /about", "In-house services: welding, penetrant inspection, punching, beading, anodizing, plating, painting, polishing, custom assembly -> /about", "99% of spinning tools and dies made in-house -> /", "Equipment includes six-axis laser cutting and M & M CNC lathe with flanging and cutting -> /", "CNC cells perform secondary operations: beading, trimming, drilling -> /", "Offers forming and stamping -> /", "Over 99% on-time delivery record -> /about", "Competitive